.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
routines used by several of the ia_*.c (icon-animation plugins). 

this is used by several of the actual plugins, so no code that is used only by a single plug-in should end up in here.
.SH "Function Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "void ani_icon_pulse (\fBicon_el\fP * el, Evas * evas, float c, float alpha, int x, int y, icon_state s)"
.PP
resize and/or fade icon. 
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIel\fP - icon-element to apply the action to 
.br
\fIevas\fP - canvas the object lives on 
.br
\fIc\fP - grow by c pixels (0...oo) 
.br
\fIalpha\fP - transparency (0.0 ... 1.0) 
.br
\fIx\fP - x-position 
.br
\fIy\fP - y-position 
.br
\fIs\fP - affect only elements that have at least on of the states in s, and are of the 'image' type.
.RE
.PP

.SS "void ani_icon_raise (\fBicon\fP * i, int f, element_tag t)"
.PP
